	column firstOrderGrossSales = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    MAX(bnpl_loss_rates[orderGrossSales]),
			    FILTER(
			        bnpl_loss_rates, 
			        bnpl_loss_rates[netsuiteId] = EARLIER(bnpl_loss_rates[netsuiteId]) && bnpl_loss_rates[rank] = 1
			    )
			)
			```
